{"4255610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Interregnum", "steam_appid": 4255610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interregnum</strong> is a turn-based card game that takes deckbuilding back to its roots with heavy inspiration from<strong> Dominion</strong>. Choose your battles wisely in this deeply strategic game where each move will bring you face-to-face with your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/extras/337b8e08fa5ef28a590c631c57956060.poster.avif?t=1787946506\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/extras/337b8e08fa5ef28a590c631c57956060.webm?t=1787946506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/extras/337b8e08fa5ef28a590c631c57956060.mp4?t=1787946506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units enter play face-down, making<strong> Interregnum</strong> a deeply strategic game of poker-like bluffs where reading your enemy is as important as reading the board. Or, throw analysis out the window with powerful<strong> Announce</strong> effects! Declare your intentions openly and dare your foes to oppose you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/extras/f39d79a1508daa59758a81c14874b5ec.poster.avif?t=1787946506\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/extras/f39d79a1508daa59758a81c14874b5ec.webm?t=1787946506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/extras/f39d79a1508daa59758a81c14874b5ec.mp4?t=1787946506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with friends or solo in a campaign mode with hours of gameplay and unique challenge runs! Learn the ins and outs of every last card in scenarios designed to push your tactics to the absolute limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/extras/97e8474c4632f294f2483a55bf5499e9.poster.avif?t=1787946506\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/extras/97e8474c4632f294f2483a55bf5499e9.webm?t=1787946506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/extras/97e8474c4632f294f2483a55bf5499e9.mp4?t=1787946506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your strategy, earn powerful units and deploy them to the battlefield as you jostle for power. Each turn is a new opportunity to gain influence - or to lick your wounds and bide your time until the board swings in your favor.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interregnum</strong> is a turn-based card game that takes deckbuilding back to its roots with heavy inspiration from<strong> Dominion</strong>. Choose your battles wisely in this deeply strategic game where each move will bring you face-to-face with your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/extras/337b8e08fa5ef28a590c631c57956060.poster.avif?t=1787946506\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/extras/337b8e08fa5ef28a590c631c57956060.webm?t=1787946506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/extras/337b8e08fa5ef28a590c631c57956060.mp4?t=1787946506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units enter play face-down, making<strong> Interregnum</strong> a deeply strategic game of poker-like bluffs where reading your enemy is as important as reading the board. Or, throw analysis out the window with powerful<strong> Announce</strong> effects! Declare your intentions openly and dare your foes to oppose you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/extras/f39d79a1508daa59758a81c14874b5ec.poster.avif?t=1787946506\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/extras/f39d79a1508daa59758a81c14874b5ec.webm?t=1787946506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/extras/f39d79a1508daa59758a81c14874b5ec.mp4?t=1787946506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with friends or solo in a campaign mode with hours of gameplay and unique challenge runs! Learn the ins and outs of every last card in scenarios designed to push your tactics to the absolute limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/extras/97e8474c4632f294f2483a55bf5499e9.poster.avif?t=1787946506\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=800 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/extras/97e8474c4632f294f2483a55bf5499e9.webm?t=1787946506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/extras/97e8474c4632f294f2483a55bf5499e9.mp4?t=1787946506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your strategy, earn powerful units and deploy them to the battlefield as you jostle for power. Each turn is a new opportunity to gain influence - or to lick your wounds and bide your time until the board swings in your favor.</p>", "short_description": "Build your deck and outwit your opponents in a love letter to classic deckbuilders like Dominion. Outflank your opponents in a deep, strategic game where superior tactics reign supreme. Defeat a cadre of unique AIs in campaign mode or play online and outwit your friends!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/b6185edaba04791fbbce5480d71723fa4e34db32/header.jpg?t=1787946506", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/125c364d18ef58301625df41909eb7ec0a66b268/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787946506", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4255610/125c364d18ef58301625df41909eb7ec0a66b268/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787946506", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-760 (4 * 2800); AMD Athlon II X4 645 AM3 (4 * 3100)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 550 Ti (3072 VRAM); Radeon HD 6850 (1024 VRAM)<br></li><